      "translation": "One day, I brought a toy spider to school. It was black, had eight legs, and looked real!\n\nI said, “It’s fake!” But a few classmates didn’t believe me. I felt a little sad and was also afraid the teacher might be startled. Next time, I would say it was a toy before taking it out.\n\nAfter school, I brought the spider to after-school care. First I said, “This is a toy spider!” and only then took it out. Everyone believed me, and nobody got scared. I was so happy!",
      "translations": [
        "One day, I brought a toy spider to school. It was black, had eight legs, and looked real!",
        "I said, “It’s fake!” But a few classmates didn’t believe me. I felt a little sad and was also afraid the teacher might be startled. Next time, I would say it was a toy before taking it out.",
        "After school, I brought the spider to after-school care. First I said, “This is a toy spider!” and only then took it out. Everyone believed me, and nobody got scared. I was so happy!"
      ],
